<title>JAPAN: Tokai Aluminum shares rise on security tag reports.</title>
<headline>Tokai Aluminum shares rise on security tag reports.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tokai Aluminum Foil Co Ltd rose in the over-the-counter market on Wednesday afternoon following media reports that its unit was increasing production of security tags for protection against shoplifting, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0531 GMT, the shares were up 20 yen at 420 yen.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
